# .trivyignore — WARP-243 pre-existing image CVE baseline. Every entry MUST
# carry: package, image(s), and the burn-down path. New CVEs are NOT added
# here casually — fix the dep; this file only exists so day-one main is
# green. Burn-down owner: Romain. Remove entries as Dependabot upgrade PRs
# land.
#
# PROVENANCE: this candidate list is derived from the 2026-07-04 OSV
# cross-check in the WARP-243 audit. The authoritative list is regenerated
# by the in-PR Trivy bootstrap run (docker-build.yml builds all 12 images
# when this workflow file changes) — dev-only deps that never reach images
# drop out, and any additional image CVE found is added with a comment.
# Fill in <run-url>/<sha> from that bootstrap run before final arming.
# bootstrap-run: <run-url>
# bootstrap-sha: <sha>

